// -------------------------------------------------------------
// Sample 8085 Assembly Program: Addition & Memory Storage
// -------------------------------------------------------------
MVI A, 05H      // Step 1: Load 05H into Accumulator A
MVI B, 0AH      // Step 2: Load 0AH into Register B
ADD B           // Step 3: Add B to A (A = 0FH)
STA 2000H       // Step 4: Store A at Memory address 2000H
INR A           // Step 5: Increment Accumulator (A = 10H)
HLT             // Step 6: Halt CPU